<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus January CPI remains steady over December.</title>
<headline>Cyprus January CPI remains steady over December.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>No changes were registered in Cyprus's consumer price index in January, which remained at 118.07 points, the statistics and research department announced.</p>
<p>Consumer price index	Jan 97   Dec 96   Jan 96</p>
<p>Month/month change (pct)   nil	 0.14     -0.15</p>
<p>Year/year change (pct)     2.66	2.51	2.50</p>
<p>Index (92=100)		118.07   118.07    115.01</p>
<p>The department said increases were recorded in the cost of electricity, rent and furniture while decreases were noted in some fresh fruits and vegetables. -- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
